OL,3,AAnthropic safety researcher says more
OL,4,Athan 10% chance AI 'could kill all
OL,5,Ahumans'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA top safety researcher at Anthropic
OL,8,Fhas warned AI is advancing so quickly
OL,9,Fthere is a greater than 10% chance it
OL,10,F"could kill all humans" within the next
OL,11,Fdecade.
OL,13,FEvan Hubinger said in a post on X that
OL,14,Fthe risk from the models which
OL,15,Fcurrently exist was "low" but he was
OL,16,F"worried" the technology may become
OL,17,Fable to improve itself soon to the
OL,18,Fpoint where it poses an existential
OL,19,Frisk to humanity.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
