OL,3,AAnthropic safety researcher says more
OL,4,Athan 10% chance AI 'could kill all
OL,5,Ahumans'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt comes after the Financial Times
OL,8,Freported Anthropic withheld its latest
OL,9,Fmodel from the UK's AI Safety
OL,10,FInstitute, one of the leading bodies in
OL,11,Fthe world for assessing AI risk.
OL,13,FThe BBC has approached Anthropic for
OL,14,Fcomment.
